  · exact graph002_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph003_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph004_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph005_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph006_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
